OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome bright or sunny spells and
OL,6,Fscattered showers. Showers will be
OL,7,Foccasionally heavy this morning but
OL,8,Fturning lighter through the afternoon.
OL,9,FFresh west or northwesterly winds,
OL,10,Foccasionally strong along the north
OL,11,Fcoast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers this evening will
OL,14,Fgradually become confined to northern
OL,15,Fcounties overnight. Elsewhere it will
OL,16,Fbecome dry overnight with clear
OL,17,Fperiods. Fresh northwesterly winds
OL,18,Feasing down.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
