OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FMostly dry with variable
OL,6,Famounts of cloud and some sunny
OL,7,Fspells. Chance of a light shower
OL,8,Facross the north at first.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,11,Fstart on Thursday before rain spreads
OL,12,Feast for a time, drier later. Dry with
OL,13,Fsunny spells on Friday. Rain likely on
OL,14,FSaturday.
